Opengeni compute

Parts of the design of compute-host follow ideas from SPACE (Sandboxed
Platform for Agentic Code Execution), https://github.com/perplexityai/SPACE,
Copyright 2026 Perplexity AI, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:

- VMs outlive the host agent and are taken back from durable per-VM records
  when it starts again.
- Every guest gets the same fixed address behind NAT in its own network
  namespace, so a guest restored from a snapshot needs no reconfiguration.

No SPACE source code is included. Where a file's design follows SPACE, its
header says so.
